  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FNs Milj&#xf6;program (Unep) f&#xf6;r Special Programme sekretariat ges st&#xf6;d till institutionell f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r en h&#xe5;llbar hantering av kemikalier och avfall, samt f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat genomf&#xf6;rande av Basel-, Rotterdam- och Stockholmskonventionerna, Minamatakonventionen och det globala ramverket f&#xf6;r kemikalier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN Environmental Programme (UNEP) Special Programme secretariat in 2025 to for institutional strengthening in developing countries for the sustainable management of chemicals and waste, and to improve the implementation of the Basel, Rotterdam, and Stockholm Conventions, the Minamata Convention, and the Global Chemicals Framework.</narrative>
